 a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 18 de diciembre de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-16 Deer Park registró 22.64 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 1:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.02 ppb. El viento venía de 306 grados a 7.1 mph. Hay 27 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. No se encontró un informe correspondiente en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87894,"sha256":"2375f9582494c8511986eacd0c1eb65559bd314ab3162542923d26f3713455d9","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:38+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"pp